      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I'd suggest leaving it as an installation option, and not make it the default - I think it would be good if we could run for one release like that to road-test before either making it the default or removing the old authN.</p>",
     "created": "11/Apr/10 1:46 PM",
