      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Discussed on April 20th committer call...Eddie + Chris like the idea of keeping the code for 3.4, but make the new AuthN code the default.</p>\n\n<p>Recomendation is to immediately make FeSL AuthN the default in trunk.  Then prior to 3.4, decide based on our confidence if it should stay that way.  </p>",
